{
  "id": "JER.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "JER",
  "reference": "Yeremia 16",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene ogwanchera obogima bwa Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase ’nde, riganteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa konyuoma omokungu bw’aase aiga, gose koiborera abana, abamura na abaiseke, aase aiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba igoro y’abana, abamura na abaiseke, abwo baiboreire aiga, naboigo igoro y’abang’ina na abaise baabaiborerete aiga ase ense eye:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amarwaire amabe nabaite bakwe. Tibakoreerwa, gose gotindekwa, korende emebere yabo nigo erabe buna obwoyo igoro ase ense. Nigo baraitwe nemioro na enchara, na emebere yabo ekwete nebe endagera ye chinyoni chia igoro na eye ching’iti chi’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Tobaisa gosoa ase enyomba ase abanto bakorera gose kobokia amagombo, na tobaisa koreera onde bwensi, gose kobaichanera. Inche narusirie omorembe one na obwanchani bwane bwa botambe, na amaabera aane korwa ase abanto aba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abanene na abake bare ase ense eye goika bakwe. Tibagotindekwa, na monto onde tari orabareere, gose gwekeba omobere, gose gokigita etukia ase engencho yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde takoa oria okwereire endagera ase okomoremia; na oria okoreera ise gose ng’ina takoremigwa ase okoegwa ekenyugwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa gosoa enyomba y’abanto bagokora omoyega na goikaransa agwo ase okoria na konywa amo nabarabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Ase engaki yaino ekero morigereretie ninsirie eriogi ri’omogooko, na erie chigosori, na eri’omonywomi, na eri’omoriakari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero orateebie abanto amang’ana aya onsi, barabwo babe bagokoboria: Nase ki Omonene arentire obobe obo obonene ase tore? Obobe bwaito mborobi? Ebibe twakorire ase Omonene, Nyasae oito, mbiribi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio obairanerie, obateebie ng’a Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: Chisokoro chiaino nigo chiantigete, chikarigia chinyasae ching’ao, chigachikorera na gochisasiima, chigantiga na chikaanga korenda amachiiko aane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainwe mwakorire amabe kobua chisokoro chiaino, ekiagera kera oyomo oino nigo akobwatia obomwenu bw’enkoro yaye embe, bwanga konyigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio nimbaserie morue ase ense eye, mogende ase ense inwe motamanyeti, gose chisokoro chiaino chitamanyete. Ase ense eyio namokorere chinyasae ching’ao omobaso na obotuko, gose tinkobarorera amaabera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoirana korwa ase obosomba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene oteebire ng’a amatuko ngocha are, ekero abanto batakwane: “Ekeene, buna omonene are moyo, oyio orusetie Abaisraeli korwa ase ense ya Misiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ribaga ri’ayio nigo barakwane: “Ekeene, buna Omonene are moyo, oyio orusetie Abaisraeli korwa ase ense ya sugusu, na korwa ase chinse chionsi, agwo ase abaseretie gochia”. Ayio nakoreke, ekiagera inche nimbairanie, mbarente ase ense yabo abanyene, eyio naete chisokoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebisusuro bikorentwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo agoteeba iga: “Nindangerie abarubi abange bachiche, barube abanto aba; magega y’ayio nindangerie abatwari abange bachiche batware abanto korwa ase kera egetunwa, na kera ekegoro, na korwa ase amakuruma ’ebitare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaiso aane nigo aroche chinchera chiabo chionsi. Tibakonyara kwebisa korwa ase ’nde. Nigo ndoche ebibe biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbae egesusuro ara kabere ase engencho y’obobe na ebibe biabo, ekiagera bakorire ense ere omwando one koba eyetachenegeti ase okoyeichoria nemegwekano y’okogechia etari moyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosaba kwa Yeremia ase okomosemeri’Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, naye chinguru chiane na orwaki rwane, nigo ore obotamero bwane ase rituko ri’emechando. Ebisaku bie chinsinyo chionsi chi’ense mbichiche asore na goteeba: “Chisokoro chiaito nigo chianyorete obong’ainereria bwoka buna omwando, na emegwekano y’ogosasimwa ere bosa, eyio tekonyara gokonya kende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Omonto nanyare kweroiseria chinyasae? Yaya, taibo. Echio tichiri Nyasae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, rora, ase engaki eyio ninyemanyekanie ase abanto bamanye chinguru chiane na okobua kwane, erinde bamanye ng’a erieta riane n’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JER.17",
    "number": "17",
